======================================================================
【1】SoC 型号 —— 判断是 RK3588 还是 RK3566（决定所有大小核/GPU/NPU/视频参数）
======================================================================
  $ cat /sys/devices/soc0/soc_id 2>/dev/null || echo "(无 soc_id)"
      (无 soc_id)

  $ cat /sys/devices/soc0/machine 2>/dev/null || echo "(无 machine)"
      (无 machine)

  $ cat /proc/device-tree/compatible 2>/dev/null | tr "\0" "\n" | head -5 || echo "(无 device-tree)"
      rockchip,rk3588s-tablet-f12-v11
      rockchip,rk3588

  $ cat /sys/devices/soc0/revision 2>/dev/null || echo "(无 revision)"
      (无 revision)

  >>> 解读提示：
      RK3588:  compatible 含 "rockchip,rk3588"
      RK3588S: compatible 含 "rockchip,rk3588s"
      RK3566:  compatible 含 "rockchip,rk3566"
      若是 RK3588，则用户资料的 A76/G610/6TOPS/8K 视频规格全部成立
      若是 RK3566，则用户资料的 A76/G610/6TOPS/8K 视频规格全部错误


